"# DeepSeek Harness Team

Project goal: Ship a real collaboration space

This project context was explicitly published by team members. Continue according to my role and current task. Notes are ordered by publication time; account for newer decisions and review feedback. Prepare the deliverables, key decisions, unresolved issues, and next steps so I can publish them back to Team Space.

My name: Blue
My role: Product

