- AGENT-NOTE

### Current acceptance criteria

Source: Blue

Decisions (one per line)
- Support keyboard and touch

Blockers (one per line)
- Pause is missing

Next steps (one per line)
- Fix the pause button

Source references (one per line)
- requirements.md

## Files

This is a shared file list, not file contents. Download needed files from the Files tab into your own project folder before asking AI to read them. Use the shared path, version label, and file ID to distinguish matching names; confirm the intended version from the latest notes and review feedback. Do not assume the files have already been read.

- /flight.png (v1.2; File ID: file-1) — Approved flight deck
- /Product/v2.0/flight.png (v2.0; File ID: file-revision) — Revised controls

## Review

### demo.md

Related task: Local work

Status: Changes requested

Review note: Pause before restarting"
`;

